{
  "info": {
    "name": "FinTrack API — Fase 1",
    "description": "Coleção de endpoints do FinTrack.\n\nSETUP\n1. Suba o servidor com `npm run dev`\n2. Rode 'Auth > Login' — o token é salvo automaticamente na variável {{token}} e usado em todas as requisições protegidas\n3. Rode 'Contas > Criar conta' e 'Categorias > Criar categoria' — os IDs são salvos em {{contaId}} e {{categoriaId}}\n4. As requisições de transação já usam essas variáveis\n\nVARIÁVEIS\nbaseUrl, token, contaId, categoriaId, transacaoId, usuarioId",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "contaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "categoriaId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "transacaoId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar usuário",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "201 Created. Retorna os dados do usuário, SEM token. A autenticação é feita no login.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Novo Usuario\",\n  \"email\": \"novo@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar — e-mail duplicado",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "409 Conflict — e-mail já cadastrado.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Novo Usuario\",\n  \"email\": \"novo@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar — senha curta",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "400 Bad Request — mínimo de 6 caracteres.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Teste\",\n  \"email\": \"curta@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "200 OK. Retorna o token. O script de teste salva o token na variável {{token}} automaticamente.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"arthur@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"123456\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token salvo na variável {{token}}');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login — senha incorreta",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "401 Unauthorized.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"arthur@email.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"senhaerrada\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil do usuário autenticado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/perfil",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "perfil"
              ]
            },
            "description": "200 OK. O campo senha não é retornado."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Perfil — sem token",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/perfil",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "perfil"
              ]
            },
            "description": "401 Unauthorized — demonstra o middleware de autenticação.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Cadastro, login e perfil. Rode o Login primeiro para popular {{token}}."
    },
    {
